          "url": "/c/rapid-rope-climbs/sections/575686/lessons/2169586",
          "description": "In today’s session, we’re putting the rope climb together. Once you can perform all the rope climbing steps twice in a row, there’s nothing stopping you from completing a full rope climb—no matter how long the rope! Remember, a successful rope climb isn’t about pulling with your arms; it’s all about pushing with your legs. You’ve got this!",
          "sections": [
