          "title": "RRC 3.1 (Week 3, Workout 1)",
          "url": "/c/rapid-rope-climbs/sections/575687/lessons/2169581",
          "description": "Welcome to Week 3 of Rapid Rope Climb! Before jumping into these more advanced techniques, make sure you’re comfortable getting up and down the rope multiple times. If you’re not quite there yet — no worries! Keep working through the earlier weeks until you feel confident with the Reach, Lift, Clamp, and Stand. If you’re ready, it’s time to level up. This week, we’ll focus on minimizing the number of pulls needed by nailing a powerful first rope jump. Start by reviewing Coach Ben’s first jump explanation video. This is a grippy session, so chalk up often and take breaks as needed to keep your grip fresh!",
          "sections": [
            {
              "name": "WARM UP",
              "items": [
